	(text "J15 SERVO 24V and J17 SERVO UART: same pinout\nas CN5 / CN13 on the MES2 Harvester, so its cables fit.\nThe FE-URT-2 turns the UART into the Feetech half-duplex\nservo bus and passes the 24 V on to the servos.\nUART on module USART2: PA2 TX → pin 4,\npin 3 → PA3 RX (5 V-tolerant).\nF9 3 A PTC on the servo 24 V. F10 1.1 A PTC on the\nFE-URT-2 5 V, fed from the screen converter so a\nservo-side short can't pull down the module supply.\n24 V only for 24 V servo types.\nBlank chip: the ST bootloader probes PA2 / PA3, so flash\nover SWD first (the normal flow)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 294.64 198.12 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "bab1719c-6d88-5f4b-a4d5-62493e571f54")
	)
